    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forþam, understande þe ðe cunne, mycel is ⁊ mære þæt sacerd ah to donne folc to þearfe, gif he his Drihtne gecwemeð mid rihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Because—let him understand who can—great and wonderful are the things which a priest is able to do for the benefit of the people, if he is duly pleasing to his Lord.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forþam, understande þe ðe cunne, mycel is ⁊ mære þæt sacerd ah to donne folc to þearfe, gif he his Drihtne gecwemeð mid rihte.</ab>
      </div>
